        ex:hasText "As CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can ensure that the solution aligns with these sustainability requirements. we have a strong focus on environmental sustainability, and we has already implemented various eco-friendly practices.  we can propose hosting solutions with we green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud or Scaleway, both located in France, which use 100% renewable energy and have a Power Usage Effectiveness (PUE) of 1.3 and 1.28 respectively." ;
