    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These practices would minimize energetic consumption and contribute to reducing the environmental footprint. we also have a carbon reporting capability based on GRI Standards (partial), which enables we to measure and report the carbon emissions of the solution. we typical energy reduction compared to the baseline is around 35%, which can be achieved through These practices." ;
