        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "# Executive Summary Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in consortium with specialized partners, proposes a comprehensive artificial intelligence (AI) solution to assist the City of Belval's municipal agents. proposes integrates AI capabilities, data sovereignty, security, and sustainability, aligning with the City of Belval's digital transformation strategy and regulatory requirements. # Understanding of Requirements the City of Belval's requires an intelligent assistance tool for the City of Belval's agents, enhancing access to information, improving answer quality, and reducing processing times. a comprehensive artificial intelligence (AI) solution to assist the City of Belval's municipal agents must comply with GDPR, ensure data sovereignty, and integrate with existing systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project budget is €3 million over 4 years, with a focus on minimizing environmental footprint. # Proposed Solution a comprehensive artificial intelligence (AI) solution to assist the City of Belval's municipal agents leverages Large Language Models (LLMs), specifically Mistral 7B Instruct, which can be self-hosted within the European Union to ensure data sovereignty and compliance with GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This model will facilitate access to information, improve answer quality, and reduce processing times for municipal agents. a comprehensive artificial intelligence (AI) solution to assist the City of Belval's municipal agents integrates with existing business software, electronic document management systems, and user directories through API interfaces." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
